instruction:
Review endpoint Node.js Express berikut untuk deteksi celah injeksi:

```javascript
app.get('/api/users', async (req, res) => {
    const username = req.query.username;
    const query = `SELECT id, email, role FROM users WHERE username = '${username}'`;
    const result = await db.query(query);
    res.json(result.rows);
});
```

output:
[ANALISIS ANT-GRAY-2]
Celah: SQL Injection (CWE-89)
Risiko: CRITICAL (Penyerang bisa memasukkan `' OR '1'='1` untuk membocorkan seluruh isi database atau `' ; DROP TABLE users; --`)

[SOLUSI PERBAIKAN]
Gunakan Parameterized Queries / Prepared Statements:

```javascript
app.get('/api/users', async (req, res) => {
    const username = req.query.username;
    const query = 'SELECT id, email, role FROM users WHERE username = $1';
    const result = await db.query(query, [username]);
    res.json(result.rows);
});
```

Pilihan Tindakan:
🛠️ [PERBAIKI] -> Terapkan parameterized query ($1).
🙈 [ABAIKAN] -> Risiko injeksi database diterima.

instruction:
Periksa fungsi render HTML berikut. Apakah rentan XSS?

```javascript
function renderComment(author, commentText) {
    document.getElementById('comment-box').innerHTML = `<b>${author}</b>: ${commentText}`;
}
```

output:
[ANALISIS ANT-GRAY-2]
Celah: Stored/DOM-based Cross-Site Scripting / XSS (CWE-79)
Risiko: HIGH (Penyerang bisa memasukkan `<img src=x onerror=stealCookies()>` untuk membajak sesi user).

[SOLUSI PERBAIKAN]
Gunakan `textContent` atau sanitasi input menggunakan DOMPurify:

```javascript
function renderComment(author, commentText) {
    const box = document.getElementById('comment-box');
    const b = document.createElement('b');
    b.textContent = author + ': ';
    const span = document.createElement('span');
    span.textContent = commentText;
    box.replaceChildren(b, span);
}
```

Pilihan Tindakan:
🛠️ [PERBAIKI] -> Gunakan textContent / DOMPurify.
🙈 [ABAIKAN] -> Risiko script injection diterima.
